<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Synthetic Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
  .header-nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .logo { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .nav-links a { margin-left: 15px; text-decoration: none; color: #333; }
  .content-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .tab-bar { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .tab-bar button { padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-bottom: none; background: #f0f0f0; cursor: pointer; }
  .tab-bar button.active { background: #fff; border-color: #ccc; border-bottom: 1px solid #fff; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
  .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .button-group button { padding: 10px 20px; margin-right: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
  .table-container { margin-top: 20px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
  .highlight-box { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-nav">
    <div class="logo">JSU</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#">Home</a>
      <a href="#">Dashboards</a>
      <a href="#">Employee</a>
      <a href="#">Student</a>
      <a href="#">DUO Resources</a>
      <a href="#">Library</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <h2>Home</h2>
    <p>Home Community / <span data-field="current_page_name">{{ current_page_name }}</span></p>

    <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <h3>Featured Links</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span data-field="featured_link_1">{{ featured_link_1 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="featured_link_2">{{ featured_link_2 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="featured_link_3">{{ featured_link_3 }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="featured_link_4">{{ featured_link_4 }}</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <h3>Announcements</h3>
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <p>Subject: <span data-field="announcement_subject">{{ announcement_subject }}</span></p>
          <p>Details: <span data-field="announcement_details">{{ announcement_details }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h3>Access Paysub on Employee Links:</h3>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;">
        <div class="logo">JSU</div>
        <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
          <p>Home Community / <span data-field="employee_page_name">{{ employee_page_name }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 20px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
          <h3>Employee Links</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_1">{{ employee_link_1 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_2">{{ employee_link_2 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_3">{{ employee_link_3 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_4">{{ employee_link_4 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_5">{{ employee_link_5 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_6">{{ employee_link_6 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="employee_link_7">{{ employee_link_7 }}</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
          <h3>Human Resources</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><span data-field="hr_link_1">{{ hr_link_1 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="hr_link_2">{{ hr_link_2 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="hr_link_3">{{ hr_link_3 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="hr_link_4">{{ hr_link_4 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="hr_link_5">{{ hr_link_5 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="hr_link_6">{{ hr_link_6 }}</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="logo">JSU</div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
      <button>Personal Information</button>
      <button>Student</button>
      <button>Financial Aid</button>
      <button class="active">Employee</button>
      <button>Finance</button>
      <button>Proxy Access</button>
      <button>Banner 9 Employee SSB</button>
      <button>Banner 9 Fin</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="search">Search</label>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
        <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Search...">
        <button>Go</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label>Pay Stub</label>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center;">
        <label>Choose a year and then select Display:</label>
        <select>
          <option>{{ current_year }}</option>
        </select>
        <button>Display</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h3>Pick Pay Period:</h3>
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Pay Stub for {{ current_year }}</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for period in pay_periods %}
            <tr>
              <td><span data-field="pay_period_start">{{ period.start_date }}</span></td>
              <td><span data-field="pay_period_end">{{ period.end_date }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="content-section">
    <p>Once you access your pay stub from any pay period you can print using the Printer Friendly button at the bottom of the screen:</p>

    <div class="highlight-box" style="text-align: center;">
      <button>Printer Friendly</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <p>Once you access your Pay Stub, you will see the Payment Summary which will provide you the Gross pay, total deductions and net amount for the current pay period and year to date:</p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Payment Summary</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Type:</td>
            <td><span data-field="summary_type">{{ summary_type }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Gross Amount:</td>
            <td><span data-field="summary_gross_amount">{{ summary_gross_amount }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Total Personal Deductions:</td>
            <td><span data-field="summary_total_deductions">{{ summary_total_deductions }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Net Amount:</td>
            <td><span data-field="summary_net_amount">{{ summary_net_amount }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <p>The next section will provide your earning detail for the pay period and YTD (will include all earnings including, but not limited to):</p>
    <ul>
      <li><span data-field="earning_type_1">{{ earning_type_1 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="earning_type_2">{{ earning_type_2 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="earning_type_3">{{ earning_type_3 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="content-section">
    <p>The next section will provide detail of deduction relating to Benefits, Deductions, and Taxes including, but not limited to:</p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Benefits, Deductions and Taxes</th>
            <th>Employee</th>
            <th>Employee YTD</th>
            <th>Employer</th>
            <th>Employer YTD</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Deduction before Federal Tax such as:</td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_1">{{ deduction_item_1 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_2">{{ deduction_item_2 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_3">{{ deduction_item_3 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_4">{{ deduction_item_4 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_5">{{ deduction_item_5 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Taxes (such as Alabama State Tax, Federal Tax, FICA – Medicare, FICA – Social Security)</td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Deductions after Federal Tax such as:</td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_6">{{ deduction_item_6 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_7">{{ deduction_item_7 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="deduction_item_8">{{ deduction_item_8 }}</span></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <p>The Pay Stub will also list information from your W-4 and State of Alabama A-4.</p>
    <p>Additionally, all employees are emailed a copy of their pay stub after each pay period.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section">
    <p>If you have questions, you may consult the following:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Payroll Department: <span data-field="payroll_email">{{ payroll_email }}</span></li>
      <li>HR Department: <span data-field="hr_email">{{ hr_email }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>